WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.441
You know I think we all know something special
happened yesterday on Brotherhood 2.0, but

00:00:15.441 --> 00:00:18.010
I don’t, I don’t think we have to talk
about it; I don’t think we have to go into

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:22.110
details about how it felt, or how wonderful
it was. Uh, it’s like the last night of

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:27.180
camp, you know? You experience it, and you
just know, because it’s in here.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:33.320
Good morning, Hank. (Wii-mote beeps) Wow it
makes noise! It’s Tuesday, January 30th,

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:43.309
hold on one second, I just, I just have to,
I just have to play my new Wiiiiiiiii!

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:53.680
Yes! Yes!

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:57.750
It occurs to me now that playing the Wii is
one of those things that feels a lot cooler

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:59.050
than it looks.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:03.640
Something from the comments: Commenter “anonymous”,
wait, isn’t that Ze Frank’s thing? Doesn’t

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.990
he say “S-something from the comments”?
We gotta think of something else; we gotta

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:13.030
have like a Voices from the Comments! “Anonymous”
says, "Hank, you keep raising the bar. I feel

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:18.030
kinda bad for John and his unenviable position
of following your postings." YOU feel kinda

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:25.159
bad for John?! Jesus, anonymous, try being
John! Ugh, what am I gonna do today? I got

00:01:25.159 --> 00:01:27.950
some in your pants jokes, anyone wanna hear
some in your pants jokes?

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:31.840
But Hank, I’d like to discuss a serious
issue, which is the issue of Everyone Poops.

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:37.590
Hank, the question I have for you and our
viewership is this: Which is funnier, Everyone

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:40.889
Poops in My Pants, or Everyone Poops in Your
Pants?

00:01:40.889 --> 00:01:46.310
Brotherhood 2.0 project: Once we decide whether
Everyone Poops in Your Pants, or Everyone

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:51.509
Poops in My Pants is funnier, I’m going
to write an entire picture book called one

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:57.369
of those two titles, which I will then read
on the air. Maybe, if we get lucky, the Yeti

00:01:57.369 --> 00:01:59.789
will do some drawings.

00:01:59.789 --> 00:02:10.910
In other news, I seem to have accidentally
Cc-ed you on an e-mail. STUPID STUPID! This

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:18.849
means that I have to do a punishment. Hank,
be kind to me. Remember, we’re brothers.

00:02:18.849 --> 00:02:20.060
I’ll see you tomorrow.

